Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.72,0:00:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,One wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want it, gotta go over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing. No time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:00:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, I\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.14,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Marked maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead at new horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In view shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who knows what's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.28,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.44,0:02:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Darkstorm, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.66,0:02:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.46,0:02:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong, Kin'emon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a problem afoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy has learned of our\Nfire and mark of the moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.22,0:02:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.46,0:02:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're into Major Hot Water now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.86,0:02:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we even fix this mess, Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We took such care to be safe\Nwhen we distributed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How in the world did\Nthey foil us like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We even chose this\Ncoded symbol and the off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.94,0:02:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,chance that it fell into unintended hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine how\Nthey were able to decode
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,our message and learn\Nof the tattoo's meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could we possibly have gone wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.96,0:02:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And our problems don't end there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.22,0:02:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are reports that\Nour allies in the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,were apprehended by Kaido\Nand Orochi's forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no use resisting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what he had.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're smart, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.78,0:03:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got the moon tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who bear that mark are\Nconsidered traitors to the Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.18,0:03:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You are to report all rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Word travels fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the capital\Nmust have heard by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We have little to no time to\Npatrol the city's bathhouses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.68,0:03:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Stealth Black could\Nhave pulled that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get him next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You were there too, if I recall, so\Ndon't pin all of that mess on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kyoshiro, I'm afraid that\NKomorosaki's wake has been cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We feared chaos would ensue with a\Ncrowd of this size in attendance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's expected that even more people will\Nshow up for the funeral tomorrow as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.10,0:04:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take extra caution, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.24,0:04:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This tragedy has caused\Nunrest among the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.00,0:04:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They may resent you for your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.38,0:04:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, there was no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm the one who suffered the\Ngreatest loss here. Where's my pity party?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I spoke to the Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.22,0:05:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The man's absolutely furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't blame him, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got this to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be friends, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So talk it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.50,0:05:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Allies keep getting caught before we even\Nget a chance to see our plan take flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.62,0:05:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been happening ever since\Nyour crew compromised us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you implying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That white bear and his friends talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How else would the enemy\Nforces know of our plan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My crew would sooner die\Nthan rat out our allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So watch your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.72,0:06:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is exactly\Nwhat they want, Traffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you mind your\Nown business, Blackleg?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down and cool your heads, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think my head is the one you\Nshould be worrying about right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In times like these, it's\Nimportant to trust your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the least\Ntrustworthy person I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh, didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the most jacked\Nup face I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what you get, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You must sever ties with\Nthose who were captured
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends are dead to\Nus now. What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A ninja knows when to cut their\Nlosses. You're scaring me, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't some child's game we're\Nplaying here, you know. It's been so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.58,0:06:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We have waited 20 years for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.46,0:07:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If we fail this time, there\Nwill be no second chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Control yourself, Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Master Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Things will not always go as we had hoped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand your frustration,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but without the help of these people whose\Ngoals miraculously align with our own,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,we'd be nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.14,0:07:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We must all work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.46,0:07:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fulfill Lord Odin's wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.92,0:07:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Party's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but overhear\Nyou from outside the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.22,0:07:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And oh boy, you folks have\Nsome nice pipes, I tell ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.98,0:07:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who even are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.68,0:07:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, what a beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you some kind of goddess?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.74,0:07:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, aren't you sweet? Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't mind if I do. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.32,0:08:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you, Yoshinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.94,0:08:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and you, Kanjuro, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.46,0:08:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like you're the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm relieved, as I got an invite to a\Nspecial event, if you catch my drift.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all the rage\Nin the capital, I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a little\Nstarstruck, truth be told.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So lay it on me, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.28,0:08:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a big battle of Bruin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You really scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.72,0:09:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, we need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.16,0:09:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want that wound opening up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta listen to it and go back to bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.28,0:09:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for your assistance, I fear\Nthat we might have died earlier today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.70,0:09:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You suffered a terrible\Nwound on our behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.98,0:09:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I can make it up to you somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it was my own fault\Nthat I got hurt like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You two had nothing to do with any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.82,0:09:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta find that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.78,0:09:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.04,0:09:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That jackass still has my shoes wet! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.38,0:10:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't stay and\Nrecover, you could die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the shoulder that got\Nstabbed, you freakin' idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies! I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.04,0:10:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.68,0:10:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay a bit longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,just until the pain goes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.36,0:10:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, you're the one who's causing my pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay, and I can help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.16,0:10:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Back in the capital, there\Nwas this toad oil I stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.40,0:10:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that I bought!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.98,0:10:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jess said you stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I paid for it, silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch what it can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes all the sword boo-boos go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.12,0:10:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it really now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's hope this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.06,0:10:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.76,0:11:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You should stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That food over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.74,0:11:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.56,0:11:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this Gyukimaru? Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.24,0:11:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The man's a well-known figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He stands guard on Bandit's bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I have reclaimed Shusui and returned\Nit to the only place that it belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That fabed sword is a\Nnational treasure that was
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,taken from the grave of the\Nlegendary samurai, Ryuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No one knows who he is\Nor from whence he hails,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But whenever anyone carrying a\Nweapon attempts to cross that bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.92,0:11:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,then you can be certain\Nthat he will appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.38,0:11:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's no need to\Nrush back and fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.26,0:11:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go deal with him later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.82,0:11:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm curious to\Nknow more about the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.46,0:12:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess first I should learn more\Nabout who's right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you and why was\Nthat Grim Reaper after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In truth, we did something that\Nearned us the wrath of one Oshogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.08,0:12:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshogun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That, uh, Orochi guy? Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Mr. Samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Dock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But when you put an O in front like other\Ngirls' names, it sounds like I'm a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope. Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But everyone laughs a lot when\NI tell them, now why not you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.10,0:12:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.84,0:12:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I assumed from the way you dressed\Nthat you were a samurai of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.88,0:12:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But it would seem you're from overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't look like a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.34,0:13:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You look very, uh, friendly. Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,On the outside, you look scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know you're nice because you\Nsaved our butts when we were in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Samurai, I'm going to tell you\Nsomething that must remain a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm searching for my older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.98,0:13:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We were separated 20 long years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.38,0:13:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I believe he may be\Nhere in Wano right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.82,0:14:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's name is Kozuki Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.70,0:14:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm his younger sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And my name is Hyori.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.53,0:14:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're his sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.42,0:14:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So my leap of faith\Npaid off, how wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.76,0:14:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it was a big leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.04,0:14:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You've met my brother before, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.52,0:14:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That must mean he's still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.06,0:14:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.48,0:14:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to process this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I heard there's a movement\Nto bring back the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you part of it? I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.84,0:14:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a friend of the\Ncause from a foreign land!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.06,0:14:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here to help my\Nbrother, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.95,0:14:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.14,0:14:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A foe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.98,0:14:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell you that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the others, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know if Kin'emon is still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And Kanjuro, Raizo, what of Kikunojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they with you as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.34,0:15:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikunojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean Kiku, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.14,0:15:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, one thing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.66,0:15:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I need some kind of proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.66,0:15:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I know you're really Momo's sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.44,0:15:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it all adds up then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.72,0:15:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo traveled two decades ahead in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.26,0:15:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's still eight years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And even though you're his younger sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're 26 now. Since\Nyou had to stay behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.70,0:15:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.98,0:15:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.02,0:15:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this twerp's\Nallowed to hear all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I already knew about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She told me a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a special secret\Nbetween the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Otoko is one of my closest friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Her smiling face has gotten\Nme through so many hard days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.56,0:16:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She reminds me of myself 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about her age on that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The day my whole world fell apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.62,0:16:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Live on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.34,0:16:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I made up my mind, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother! Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I won't leave you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,At the time, I had no understanding\Nof what was occurring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, right before my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My beloved brother and the others\Nall vanished into the flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:17:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I could even process the death\Nof my father, I lost my mother as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything was taken\Nfrom me in a single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.74,0:17:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told that my brother\Nwould return in twenty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But after a tragedy so great, such an\Nimmaterial hope offered me little solace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.52,0:17:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I completely lost the will to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.36,0:17:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't they have you jump\Ninto the future with your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It was either him or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't let the Kozuki bloodline die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.10,0:17:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If something happened to both\Nof us, then all would be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.76,0:17:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.40,0:17:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I was never completely alone, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My father's ally,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,a kindly retainer named Kawamatsu the\NKappa, raised me with patience and care.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A Kappa? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.12,0:17:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe that he's\None of those river creatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.94,0:17:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's not ashamed of that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He takes pride in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The day that the castle burned\Ndown, we were surrounded by enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,However, he helped me escape\Nthrough the moat undetected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.88,0:18:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, just a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.20,0:18:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,After losing my father, mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.64,0:18:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and brother, the shock robbed\Nme of my ability to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but he did his utmost best to cheer me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, this is the cup-a-dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.80,0:18:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise, I brought you food. Dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.02,0:18:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tummy is saying it's\Nhungry, too, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.30,0:18:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I have a bit of an\Nupset stomach, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.28,0:18:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why it's being so noisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.58,0:18:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a fib.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.36,0:18:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you at least put\Nhalf of this with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.70,0:18:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I found a grilled fish\Nswimming in the river earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A grilled fish was in\Nthe water? Yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.38,0:19:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I filleted and gobbled up\Nthat tasty little fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't you worry about me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.26,0:19:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He would always make sure to feed me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,even if that meant there\Nwas nothing left for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.62,0:19:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe everything to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.46,0:19:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,His kindness allowed\Nme to smile once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for his help,\NI'd have been lost to sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was about 13, we were separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.66,0:19:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Since then, I haven't seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,However, he is a samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu must be out there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.24,0:19:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly he's waiting for the day of\Nthe great battle to make his return.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How I wish to see him again,\Nas well as the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never met a real Cape before!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.08,0:19:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Zorojuro? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may ask you, who's here to\Nhelp prepare for the big uprising?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.28,0:20:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a few of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.32,0:20:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So the doggie and the kitty\Nare with you as well? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.42,0:20:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But I had heard that they were both dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I was certain I would\Nnever see them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.98,0:20:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think Cat Vipers arrived here\Nyet, but he's involved in the plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.32,0:20:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am just so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't cry. Now I am\Na samurai's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Considering that the\Ndoggy and kitty made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.28,0:20:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Back all of the Akazaya\N9 could reunite that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,would be like a dream\Nwell don't get your hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.06,0:21:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's Kin'emon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,then Kanjuro, Raizo, Okiku,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.84,0:21:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogstorm, and Cat Viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.70,0:21:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the six we have contact\Nwith, plus Momonosuke, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've never even met the other\Nthree, so who knows where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.54,0:21:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them is Kawamatsu,\Nwhom I just told you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.32,0:21:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The last three are him,\NDenjiro, and Ashura Doji.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.92,0:21:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,While I certainly do not know\Nwhere they are currently,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.70,0:21:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray that they are alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.92,0:21:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But the entire flower capital is in\Nan uproar over this symbolic flyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I am certain they know and will appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.70,0:21:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the flyers we handed\Nout to the rebels earlier, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.00,0:21:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.88,0:21:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to all this commotion,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.36,0:21:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the word has gotten out to\Njust about everyone you could imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.62,0:21:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not exactly ideal for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.40,0:21:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the whole world\Nknows our meeting place,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.76,0:22:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and with all the arrests,\Nwe're down a few men, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's looking pretty dicey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.72,0:22:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything will be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have absolute faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.00,0:22:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.38,0:22:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Too many men at the helm\Nalways sinks the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.22,0:22:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to sit here and\Nsweat the details. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.78,0:22:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you to relax so you can heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.72,0:22:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's out of your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.52,0:22:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.64,0:22:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to tell me twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.58,0:22:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Otoko, can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.10,0:22:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.64,0:22:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Such good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.98,0:22:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.32,0:22:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.02,0:22:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best day ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.06,0:22:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.70,0:22:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,With all of this racket, I'm\Nnever going to get to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.12,0:23:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's eight years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.06,0:23:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.18,0:23:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,To think he's still but a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.42,0:23:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll all be just as I remember\Nthem from two decades ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.26,0:23:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what will happen once I see\Nthem all again, but that's selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I should wait till the battle's won.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.32,0:23:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wish to distract. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.34,0:23:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.22,0:23:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.62,0:23:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have thought there were\Nso many conspirators amongst us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.80,0:23:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All who are present, bear\Nwitness to these traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.92,0:24:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the faces of\Nthose who dare to take a
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.76,0:24:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,stand against Shogun\NOrochi and Commander Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.78,0:24:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop stalling!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.38,0:24:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I do sympathize.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.94,0:24:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been plotting this for\Nquite some time, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.32,0:24:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And you failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.54,0:24:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Fukurokuju, sir, please don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.52,0:24:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.12,0:24:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think these ankle tattoos\Nare a sign that we're criminals?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.32,0:24:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is but a popular design.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.42,0:24:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We have nothing to do with any rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.56,0:24:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.47,0:24:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then, I challenge you to\Nexplain the meaning of this flyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.48,0:24:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The implication is quite clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.08,0:24:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why else would there be a reversed\Ncrescent moon at the center?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.64,0:24:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how you look at it, it spells\Nout insurrection against Shogun Oroji.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.82,0:24:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It undoubtedly resembles your tattoos.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.02,0:24:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've caused enough trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.24,0:25:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now accept your punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.42,0:25:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They're in some deep crap, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.60,0:25:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope nobody thinks we talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.04,0:25:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They know we would never\Nrat them out, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.60,0:25:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.50,0:25:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, Captain\NLaw will have our backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.50,0:25:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Show us what else you got!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.22,0:25:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I could go for a bit of sumo myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.38,0:26:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Medilloman.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.78,0:26:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a mess. You up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.74,0:26:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a gift or tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.18,0:26:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.09,0:26:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body looks pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.90,0:26:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That I can work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.48,0:26:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You think this is fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.20,0:26:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,These are loaded with\NC-prism stone bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.10,0:26:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be smiling for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.02,0:26:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on and try me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.74,0:26:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's over for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.72,0:26:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.00,0:26:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing isn't over, not by a long shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.58,0:26:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.96,0:26:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, head to the right,\Nduck, and then jump up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.80,0:26:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.78,0:26:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now! Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.50,0:26:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.72,0:26:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Get done!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.56,0:26:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As instructed. Daniel! Then jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.20,0:26:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.40,0:26:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.54,0:26:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.56,0:27:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.64,0:27:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.12,0:27:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.52,0:27:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You pulled it off! What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.46,0:27:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you able to see the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.50,0:27:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.00,0:27:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That does it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.18,0:27:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't know what\Ntrick you just pulled,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.74,0:27:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm done screwing around with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.30,0:27:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man, head to the left! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.22,0:27:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.34,0:27:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.42,0:27:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.96,0:27:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tricky old fart!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.62,0:27:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.94,0:27:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.62,0:27:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're playing in my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.66,0:27:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.58,0:28:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need to try a little harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.02,0:28:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.22,0:28:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.08,0:28:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.94,0:28:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.50,0:28:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No contact! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.54,0:28:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.38,0:28:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then. Let's roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.32,0:28:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.92,0:28:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That was just normal armament Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.54,0:28:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.48,0:28:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Arm-a-day fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.36,0:28:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.58,0:28:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't figure out\Nhow I'm messing this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.32,0:28:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.23,0:28:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go to hit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.72,0:28:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpaca Fancy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.64,0:29:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.55,0:29:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way should I go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.58,0:29:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You listening, Mr. Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.52,0:29:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.58,0:29:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold tight, it'll be easier this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.32,0:29:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.70,0:29:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this thing. I'll pack a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.76,0:29:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.96,0:29:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.58,0:29:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I already feel awful over\Nhow much trouble I've caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.24,0:29:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I think the heavier I\Nam, the better, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.32,0:29:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.52,0:29:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll help with my training.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.64,0:29:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.16,0:29:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I must admit, this was a brilliant idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.58,0:29:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Crystal clear and straight to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.88,0:29:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a fool like me could tell\Nwhat the two flaming birds meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.46,0:30:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going down the day of\Nthe fire festival at twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.42,0:30:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the meetin' place is Habu Port.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.66,0:30:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I gotta say, Kinama did good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.22,0:30:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.84,0:30:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.00,0:30:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, what's with the long face, Shinobu?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.74,0:30:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheer up, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.10,0:30:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I really can't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.44,0:30:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be pretty glum myself in your shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.00,0:30:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan is coming apart at the seams.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.02,0:30:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And the bad guys are in the know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.34,0:30:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, quite regrettable. It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.62,0:30:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It also grieves me to know\Nthat our comrades bearing
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.60,0:30:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the tattoo have been\Napprehended on our account.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.20,0:30:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, if only you could\Nclaim it was all a lie,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.98,0:30:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but then you'd mislead\Nyour allies too well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.28,0:30:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in quite the pickle here, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.58,0:30:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's such a shame, I.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.38,0:30:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I'd known about\Nthose ankle tattoos sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.88,0:31:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But tattoo or no, folks are watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.20,0:31:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, still no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.18,0:31:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't figure this thing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.38,0:31:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.70,0:31:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They went flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.50,0:31:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you not want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.40,0:31:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not that simple old man i want to\Nthrow a punch and knock them back but do it
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.26,0:31:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,without contact i gotta\Nlearn i have a feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.30,0:31:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,that's what it's gonna\Ntake to break through
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.18,0:31:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,kaido's tough scales you want to send people\Nflying without touching them yeah i've
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.14,0:31:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,seen it done before by\Ntwo people but i can't
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.20,0:31:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,figure out how it works first was railing
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.04,0:31:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The second was by a\Nbattle axe guy. They were
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.16,0:31:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,using armament Haki why can't i do it like
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.94,0:32:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,they did Haki must be\Nthe foreign terminology
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.14,0:32:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,for it hang on you know it an invisible
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.66,0:32:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,power from within the body we have something\Nlike that here in wano you can use it
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.00,0:32:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,with a blade too strongly\Nenough to cut iron
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.22,0:32:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,or Gently enough to leave paper unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.14,0:32:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's entirely up to the wielder.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.98,0:32:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.48,0:32:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.28,0:32:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.06,0:32:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a death wish or something\Ngetting this close to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.90,0:32:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch, Mr. Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.90,0:32:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I will now demonstrate the\Ntechnique I was referring to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.24,0:32:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.40,0:32:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So even though he's a prisoner\Nstuck in this sick execution game,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.56,0:32:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,he's still working on making\Nhimself even stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.36,0:32:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.14,0:32:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like before, give me directions!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.78,0:32:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.76,0:33:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The fluffy guy is gonna use\Nhis right hand to swing! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.12,0:33:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.26,0:33:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.06,0:33:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can hit me, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.56,0:33:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.50,0:33:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.04,0:34:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, old guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.92,0:34:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Man Yo took down a gifter!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.90,0:34:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Man, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.20,0:34:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, I'm a little surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.80,0:34:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought the old coot would already\Nhave one foot in the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.46,0:34:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still got some pep!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.48,0:34:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.72,0:34:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.74,0:34:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been Hyogoro the flower all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.64,0:34:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Mr. Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.74,0:34:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that what you were attempting to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.84,0:34:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like that attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.74,0:34:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, then maybe I\Ncan help you after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.26,0:34:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You really did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.46,0:34:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you teach me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.74,0:35:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You
